{
  "$comment": [
    "The approved palette, as the design artboards declare it: the record every shipped colour is measured from. Nothing is emitted from this file; the build reads every other tokens/*.json and skips it.",
    "dark and light are the artboards' .app and .app.light blocks, declaration for declaration, each with the custom property that ships it (token), or null where the kit has no token for it and a note saying why. The twelve artboards declare the same two blocks byte for byte. literals are the colours the artboards spell outside those blocks, identically in both palettes.",
    "A token whose shipped value is not the value here names this value in its own comment, with the dE of the move and the rule that forced it. scripts/fit-palette.mjs recomputes those moves from this file: the least total move from these values that clears every rule in test/palette.mjs.",
    "Values are verbatim but for spelling: a hex in lower case, and an rgba() with a leading zero on its alpha and a space after each comma."
  ],
